	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10634"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174" title="View the profile of Delheru">Delheru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 104<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg10634#msg10634"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg10634#msg10634">Re: What class will you play in EQ2?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> August 30, 2004, 11:08:35 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1066.msg10612#msg10612">Quote from: Uuldiin on August 30, 2004, 01:16:50 am</a></div><div class="quote">WoW&#039;s not that great you know.<br /></div><br />From what I&#039;ve seen, I definitely prefer WoW though. The relatively high end content (Blackrock Depths) seems really rather well thought out as a dungeon, and in general it&#039;s very relaxing to do every now and then I&#039;m sure. The quests make the game have more of a point, though obviously at some point you will have done all the quests, and there will be a question of &quot;then what?&quot;, which the development team is keeping a secret at this time at the very least.<br /><br />Uuldiin I&#039;m curious what you dislike about WoW.<br /><br />It&#039;s still in beta so I&#039;m not judging it yet, but I like many of the things I see, and considering &lt;Ascentx&gt; has 36 active players in it, I&#039;m not exactly the only one.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10636"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
